    "brothAndToppings": {
      "status": "known",
      "value": "Tonkotsu: creamy pork broth, confit pork, shio tare, pickled egg. Shoyu beef steak: Omaha beef, clear rich broth, shoyu tare and ajitama. Shoyu chicken: breast, chicken wonton, clear broth and egg. Miso: kohlrabi, shiitake and sesame. Wagyu tantanmen: ground A5 wagyu, deep broth, sesame tare and egg; veggie tantan has creamy sesame tare, tofu, cucumber and chili crisp. Broader menu includes robata grill, udon, sushi, kobachi and donburi.",
